        "original_id": "db45082c-4fbd-527c-bbcb-b6a377e58aee",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Spam musubi, Spam, Treet\n- Companies: Hormel Foods Corporation, Armour/Pinnacle Foods\n- Places: Hawaii\n- Concepts: omusubi, canned meat products\n\nFacts:\n- Spam is a brand of canned cooked meat made by Hormel Foods Corporation.\n- Treet is a canned meat product similar to Spam and is marketed in the USA by Armour/Pinnacle Foods.\n- Spam musubi is a popular snack and lunch food in Hawaii.\n- Spam musubi consists of a slice of grilled Spam on top of a block of rice, wrapped with nori in the tradition of Japanese omusubi.",
